      "mergedPostDetails": "VRChat Version: 1258\nDescription of the bug: Joining a new world and repeating the last message you sent in the chatbox from a previous world will cause the UTF8 characters to become invisible in the mirror. \nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?): Copy and paste a message with emojis into the chatbox, switch worlds, paste the EXACT SAME message again into the chatbox, look at a mirror. The emojis/UTF8 symbols(other language symbols too) will be invisible in the mirror but appear in the chatbot when looked at directly. \nCurrent Fix: send a new different message to the chatbox then the old message will show UTF8 characters in mirrors again",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Chatbox symbols invisible in mirror on joining new world",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "63651ca44558c50b4b4e33f7",
